// pottery_oven) and the Fremenniks' keep their ids. Their examines moved here
// from examine.loc; those without one take 289's. 289's wheel has no op;
// 2011's Form is left unanswered, as void-634 leaves it. 289's
// forceapproach and ops are the client's, so they are left to the cache.

